<content>
1: {
2:   "summary": "HtmlAgilityPack 是一个 .NET 平台的敏捷 HTML 解析库，能将"真实世界"中不规范的 HTML 文档解析为可读写的 DOM 对象模型。其对象模型类似 System.Xml，但专为 HTML 设计，支持 XPath 查询与 XSLT 转换，对畸形 HTML 有极强的容错能力。主要面向 .NET 开发者，用于网页抓取、HTML 文档处理与数据提取。",
3:   "categories": [
4:     {
5:       "name": "HTML 文档解析与 DOM 构建",
6:       "description": "将 HTML 文本/流/文件解析为可操作的 DOM 树，支持编码自动检测、容错解析与多种加载方式",
7:       "evidence": ["src/HtmlAgilityPack.Shared/HtmlDocument.cs", "src/HtmlAgilityPack.Shared/HtmlDocument.PathMethods.cs"]
8:     },
9:     {
10:       "name": "DOM 节点操作与遍历",
11:       "description": "提供 HtmlNode/HtmlAttribute/HtmlNodeCollection 等核心类型，支持节点增删改查、父子遍历与属性操作",
12:       "evidence": ["src/HtmlAgilityPack.Shared/HtmlNode.cs", "src/HtmlAgilityPack.Shared/HtmlAttribute.cs", "src/HtmlAgilityPack.Shared/HtmlNodeCollection.cs"]
13:     },
14:     {
15:       "name": "XPath 查询与导航",
16:       "description": "通过 HtmlNodeNavigator 实现 XPath 导航，支持 SelectNodes/SelectSingleNode 等 XPath 查询",
17:       "evidence": ["src/HtmlAgilityPack.Shared/HtmlNode.Xpath.cs", "src/HtmlAgilityPack.Shared/HtmlNodeNavigator.cs", "src/HtmlAgilityPack.Shared/HtmlDocument.Xpath.cs"]
18:     },
19:     {
20:       "name": "Web 内容获取",
21:       "description": "HtmlWeb 类提供从 HTTP/HTTPS URL 加载 HTML 文档的能力，支持缓存、代理、认证与编码检测",
22:       "evidence": ["src/HtmlAgilityPack.Shared/HtmlWeb.cs", "src/HtmlAgilityPack.Shared/Metro/HtmlWeb.cs"]
